"HELP response: Flexible Timers sends account verification codes and\n      reminder SMS you schedule for yourself. Help:\n      https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Reply STOP to opt out." = "HELPالرد:Flexible Timersيرسل أكواد التحقق من الحساب وتذكيرSMSيمكنك تحديدها بنفسك. المساعدة:https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html.الردSTOPلإلغاء الاشتراك.";
